"""Management and monitoring CLI for a local Immich server.

The photo pipeline is iPhone -> Immich iOS app -> Immich server. This tool is
not part of it: it installs the official Immich compose stack, starts and stops
it, and reports what the Immich API and the local system can actually tell.
"""

